<mxCell id="t109" value="Base game (main paper) = this tree without the early-stage deception (D₁–D₃ actions) and without SAFETY_INTERLOCK / CONTAINED_SAFE.  Those are the stage-conditioned extension — a real defender move at every stage.  At any stage, if the 12-turn horizon expires before PHYSICAL → WITHDRAWN (0)." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780.0" y="1210.0" width="1300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
